{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/2e8d3bf3592215b5077db21f70e74506/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_09_09_26_0.jpeg\"/><p>土瓜灣永耀街3號一唐樓發生傷人血案。今(17日)早上約7時，一名女住客在三樓一單位聽到敲門聲，開門時遭5至6人用鎚仔襲擊，歹徒闖入單位掠去事主3000元現金及手機，隨後奪門而逃，女事主手腳淌血受傷，警方接報到場，將受傷事主送院救治。探員正在場調查。據悉，女事主與歹徒是相識的。</p><img alt=\"單位外地面遺下血迹。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d457d55d51a65882e008ce941dcef78/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_33.jpeg\" title=\"單位外地面遺下血迹。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>單位外地面遺下血迹。楊偉亨攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/92268f332202cb2acd062e1997cd5b3a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/222cc7e47ca48ae4115f3e07523c8849/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_29_1_.jpeg\" title=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fdd06e534ea796a9a2bcfa7825d9b6fb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_29.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T01:19:16.177436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:13:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T01:17:44.954096+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:17:44.954096+00:00","content_hash":"5a252a1af7a0ebbc9511206362177a46e314a0d812d1e8192050bfd18bbbd76d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}